      "content": "Definition: Understandability refers to how easily developers can comprehend and maintain the test code.\n\nTask: Improve the understandability of the test `ByteOrderMark_ESTest_test07.java` (path:- /Users/tenghaha/Projects/New_Agent_understandability_improvement/data/original/commons-io/auto/testcases/ByteOrderMark_ESTest/ByteOrderMark_ESTest_test07.java). The refactored code must be syntactically correct and compilable against the provided CUT signatures. Do not alter the runtime behaviour of the original test: the same methods must be called with the same arguments and produce the same expected outcomes.\n"
